<title>PHILIPPINES: JG Summit 9-mth net at 2.2 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>JG Summit 9-mth net at 2.2 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)	    12.988 vs 10.285</p>
<p>    Net income (billion)	   2.205 vs  2.033</p>
<p>Note: Full name JG Summit Holdings Inc. The company said figures exclude extraordinary gains of 1.924 billion pesos from sale of an equity investment.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
